Blackjak v1.01 (11/12/95)
==============

A fully playable casino blackjack game for the Psion 3a, including full rules
and playing options.  Up to six human or computer opponents play against the
computer controlled dealer.  Full on-line help is included.


Installation
------------

Copy blackjak.opa to your desired \APP\ directory, copy cards32.fon to a
\FON\ directory.  Install blackjak.opa on the system screen using the menu
option Apps -> Install.  The blackjak icon (a Jack and an Ace) should appear.
Select this to start the game.


